From 22a3e4b2c92ff3a42f4fc35a9defd22532c6c0e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 30 May 2026 16:28:02 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(android): correct RevenueCat Play Store API key typo
 (digit 0 -> letter O)

The hardcoded _androidApiKey in subscription_service.dart had
'goog_ZxxXVaTzAedcvvJ0EUHtjYuUyVE' (digit zero at position 23) when the
actual RevenueCat Play Store key is 'goog_ZxxXVaTzAedcvvJOEUHtjYuUyVE'
(capital letter O at position 23). Single-character transcription error.

Symptoms this fix resolves on Android:
  - Every RevenueCat call returns InvalidCredentialsError
  - Offerings fetch fails on launch
  - Customer info fetch fails on launch
  - Purchases.logIn (called from SessionManager after Google/Apple
    sign-in) throws PlatformException(11), bubbling up to the auth
    flow and showing 'Google sign-in failed' even though the actual
    Google auth + backend response both succeeded

iOS is unaffected (uses _appleApiKey which is correct).

Follow-up worth considering (not in this PR):
  Move the API keys out of the committed source. They're public SDK
  keys so this isn't critical, but using --dart-define at build time
  (or a gitignored config file loaded at runtime) makes rotation
  easier and avoids ever shipping the wrong key again.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 mobile/lib/services/subscription_service.dart | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/mobile/lib/services/subscription_service.dart b/mobile/lib/services/subscription_service.dart
index f5a8183..12f16a8 100644
--- a/mobile/lib/services/subscription_service.dart
+++ b/mobile/lib/services/subscription_service.dart
@@ -5,7 +5,7 @@ import '../config/app_config.dart';
 class SubscriptionService {
   // RevenueCat API keys — one per platform
   static const String _appleApiKey = 'appl_ESkZxQXdLyJjZGPyXwhMtegGhoC';
-  static const String _androidApiKey = 'goog_ZxxXVaTzAedcvvJ0EUHtjYuUyVE';
+  static const String _androidApiKey = 'goog_ZxxXVaTzAedcvvJOEUHtjYuUyVE';
 
   // Entitlement identifiers (must match RevenueCat dashboard)
   static const String entitlementHeritage = 'heritage_access';
